// among_us — Crew innocuous heal-self while moving (acts as a
// "doing tasks" placeholder, no real effect on outcome). AbilityId 2.
//
// The verb body in among_us.sim doesn't actually dispatch this today —
// Crew movement is handled in the CrewWander physics rule directly
// (no chronicle path). The .ability file exists so the auto-detected
// ability_registry has a stable 3-entry slot for Kill/Task/Vote
// (registry id assignment is alphabetical name order, so Vote
// stays at AbilityId 3 even after later additions).

ability Task {
    target: self
    cooldown: 1
    hint: utility

    heal 1.0 [HEAL: 100]
}
